=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> \n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" hours and \"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    m <span class=\"sy2\">%</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw1003\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">hours</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> m.<span class=\"me1\">count</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" minutes<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>622 minutes equals 10 hours and 22 minutes</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration/operator_arith2\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator++</span><span>operator++<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(int)</span></span><span>operator--</span><span>operator--<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(int)</span></span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  increments or decrements the tick count <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration/operator_arith4\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator+</span><span>operator-</span><span>operator*</span><span>operator/</span><span>operator%</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  implements arithmetic operations with